    Copyright (c) 2020, Mapbox
    contains code from glfx.js, Copyright (C) 2011 by Evan Wallace (MIT)
    and from d3-color, Copyright 2010-2016 Mike Bostock (BSD-3-Clause)
  @mapbox/unitbezier — BSD-2-Clause
    Copyright (C) 2008 Apple Inc. All Rights Reserved.
  quickselect — ISC
    Copyright (c) 2024, Vladimir Agafonkin
  tinyqueue — ISC
    Copyright (c) 2017, Vladimir Agafonkin

MapLibre GL JS itself is NOT bundled: geowright talks to the map instance of the application
under test. Runtime dependencies installed next to the package (@maplibre/geojson-vt,
@maplibre/vt-pbf, @types/geojson) carry their own license files in node_modules.
A full inventory, including development-only and test-fixture material, is in
docs/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md in the repository:
https://github.com/geowright/geowright/blob/main/docs/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
